```

This prints "Hello, World!" to the console.

To make it more interesting, you could add a loop that prints "Hello, World!" every second:

```
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    printf("Hello, World!\n");
    for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
        printf("Hello, World!\n");
    }
    return 0;
}
```

This prints "Hello, World!" 10 times.

